{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30399","headline":"山阳韦中丞罢郡因献 · 赵嘏","name":"山阳韦中丞罢郡因献","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"笙歌只是旧笙歌，肠断风流奈别何。\n照物二年春色在，感恩千室泪痕多。\n尽将魂梦随西去，犹望旌旗暂一过。\n今日尊前无限思，万重云月隔烟波。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"赵嘏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30399.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30399","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}